+
+Status: **DONE_WITH_CONCERNS**, ready for controller review. Work is bounded to the authorized local synthetic permission spike, not formal B1. Task4 application baseline is `146073bcf80d1b16905e5584f9f9922fedb29227`; concurrent controller-only commits are intentionally excluded from this task's scoped commit. Full24 groups/168 subcases, UI/deployment/performance and overall Go remain incomplete. No subagents were spawned; no Docker/controller/planning inputs were edited.
